# Pins the dev build (npm run dev / launch.bat) to the dev HO server
# (192.168.10.80), never the production HO server (192.168.10.73) -- overrides
# both the hardcoded default AND any stale apiBaseUrl saved in this Electron
# profile's localStorage (see state/session.js's DEV_API_BASE_URL). Without
# this, a dev window with no prior Settings change silently talks to
# production and every fix looks "not working" even when the code is correct
# (confirmed 2026-10-17: production's /qty-check response had no IsOffer field
# at all -- that's what made the gift icon look broken across multiple
# relaunches; .80 has it, confirmed by direct API check).
VITE_DEV_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.10.80:8000
